			"Message": "chore(deps): Bump pozil/auto-assign-issue from 2.2.0 to 2.2.1\n\nBumps [pozil/auto-assign-issue](https://github.com/pozil/auto-assign-issue) from 2.2.0 to 2.2.1.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/pozil/auto-assign-issue/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/pozil/auto-assign-issue/compare/v2.2.0...v2.2.1)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: pozil/auto-assign-issue\n  dependency-version: 2.2.1\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>",
